INSERT INTO guide VALUES('NCT05842941','checks','chk:0705','check','','judgment','','{"kind": "judgment", "text": "Use a listed highly effective contraceptive method together with a male barrier method: IUD, IUS, bilateral tubal ligation, ovulation-inhibiting implantable progestogen contraception, ovulation-inhibiting combined hormonal contraception (oral, intravaginal, transdermal, or injectable), ovulation-inhibiting progestogen-only contraception (oral or injectable), or qualifying azoospermia; abstinence is an alternative.", "from_event": "", "to_event": "", "first_event": "", "then_event": "", "event": "", "value_name": "", "operator": "", "limit": null, "limit2": null, "value_unit": "", "unit": "", "min": null, "max": null, "applies_when": "for male participants with female partners of childbearing potential", "exception": "acceptable abstinence", "quote": "Table: Highly Effective Methods a to be used in combination with a male barrier method (e.g. condom)", "section_id": "regimen_g:s090", "from_event_id": "", "to_event_id": "", "first_event_id": "", "then_event_id": "", "event_id": "", "value_name_id": "", "code": false, "id": "chk:0705"}','','[]',6705,'master=6.0 (14 Oct 2024) sha256:28e3263947cc; regimen_g=2.0 (18 Dec 2023) sha256:2308a883adb7; site_edc_guide=1.0 sha256:c631de9ef9f3; site_irt_guide=sha256:7c030baf67bb; site_lab_manual=2.0 (Dec 2023) sha256:9239cb6e1799; site_pharmacy_manual=2.0 sha256:9586af7f3f43');
